{"id":12577,"date":"2025-06-03T08:05:42","date_gmt":"2025-06-03T08:05:42","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?p=12577"},"modified":"2025-06-03T08:05:42","modified_gmt":"2025-06-03T08:05:42","slug":"revoluce-v-mikrobiologii-identifikace-mikroorganismu-a-detekce-amr-behem-nekolika-minut-diky-maap-ir-a-atr-ftir-spektroskopii","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/revoluce-v-mikrobiologii-identifikace-mikroorganismu-a-detekce-amr-behem-nekolika-minut-diky-maap-ir-a-atr-ftir-spektroskopii\/","title":{"rendered":"Revoluce v mikrobiologii: identifikace mikroorganism\u016f a detekce AMR b\u011bhem n\u011bkolika minut d\u00edky MAAP-IR a ATR-FTIR spektroskopii"},"content":{"rendered":"<p data-start=\"313\" data-end=\"559\">Seznamte se <a href=\"https:\/\/www.news-medical.net\/webinar\/Transforming-microbiology-with-Microbira-ATR-FTIR-spectroscopy-and-MAAP-IR-for-rapid-microorganism-identification-and-AMR-detection\"><strong>na webin\u00e1\u0159i<\/strong><\/a> s pokro\u010dilou analytickou platformou <strong data-start=\"361\" data-end=\"382\">Microbira MAAP-IR<\/strong>, kter\u00e1 ve spojen\u00ed s <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/nicolet-summit\/\"><strong>ATR FTIR<\/strong><\/a> p\u0159in\u00e1\u0161\u00ed <strong data-start=\"433\" data-end=\"498\">rychlou, p\u0159esnou a bezreagentovou identifikaci mikroorganism\u016f<\/strong> p\u0159\u00edmo z kultiva\u010dn\u00ed plotny \u2013 a to <strong data-start=\"532\" data-end=\"558\">b\u011bhem m\u00e9n\u011b ne\u017e 5 minut<\/strong>. Webin\u00e1\u0159 se kon\u00e1 ve <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>\u010dtvrtek 26. \u010dervna v 17:00<\/strong><\/span> a <a href=\"https:\/\/www.news-medical.net\/webinar\/Transforming-microbiology-with-Microbira-ATR-FTIR-spectroscopy-and-MAAP-IR-for-rapid-microorganism-identification-and-AMR-detection\"><strong>registrovat se na n\u011bj m\u016f\u017eete zde<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"561\" data-end=\"580\">Co MAAP-IR um\u00ed?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"582\" data-end=\"776\">MAAP-IR (Microbira Advanced Analytical Platform \u2013 InfraRed) je sofistikovan\u00fd software navr\u017een\u00fd pro efektivn\u00ed vyu\u017eit\u00ed dat z FTIR spektroskopie. Vyu\u017e\u00edv\u00e1 pokro\u010dil\u00e9 algoritmy a um\u011blou inteligenci k:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"834\">p\u0159esn\u00e9 identifikaci \u0161irok\u00e9ho spektra mikroorganism\u016f,<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"887\">rychl\u00e9 detekci antimikrobi\u00e1ln\u00ed rezistence (AMR),<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"975\">zjednodu\u0161en\u00ed a zrychlen\u00ed laboratorn\u00edch proces\u016f bez nutnosti chemick\u00e9 p\u0159\u00edpravy vzork\u016f.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"1227\">V r\u00e1mci prezentace p\u0159edstav\u00edme <strong data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1059\">klinicky ov\u011b\u0159en\u00e1 data, p\u0159\u00edpadov\u00e9 studie z praxe<\/strong> a n\u00e1zorn\u011b uk\u00e1\u017eeme, jak lze MAAP-IR snadno za\u010dlenit do st\u00e1vaj\u00edc\u00edch identifika\u010dn\u00edch workflow \u2013 a\u0165 u\u017e pracujete s MALDI-TOF, biochemick\u00fdmi testy nebo klasickou kultivac\u00ed.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1269\">Pro koho je tato technologie ur\u010dena?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1316\">MAAP-IR p\u0159in\u00e1\u0161\u00ed revolu\u010dn\u00ed \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed zejm\u00e9na pro:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1346\"><strong data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1343\">klinick\u00e9 laborato\u0159e<\/strong>,<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1378\"><strong data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1375\">veterin\u00e1rn\u00ed pracovi\u0161t\u011b<\/strong>,<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1415\"><strong data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1412\">laborato\u0159e ve\u0159ejn\u00e9ho zdrav\u00ed<\/strong>,<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1483\"><strong data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1438\">men\u0161\u00ed pracovi\u0161t\u011b<\/strong> hledaj\u00edc\u00ed kompaktn\u00ed diagnostick\u00e9 n\u00e1stroje,<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1486\" data-end=\"1579\"><strong data-start=\"1486\" data-end=\"1506\">v\u011bt\u0161\u00ed laborato\u0159e<\/strong>, kde m\u016f\u017ee slou\u017eit jako z\u00e1lo\u017en\u00ed nebo specializovan\u00fd identifika\u010dn\u00ed syst\u00e9m.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1727\">Chcete-li zefektivnit svou mikrobiologickou diagnostiku, <strong data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1677\">bez ztr\u00e1ty p\u0159esnosti \u010di robustnosti<\/strong>, MAAP-IR je n\u00e1stroj, kter\u00fd by v\u00e1m ur\u010dit\u011b nem\u011bl uniknout.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Seznamte se na webin\u00e1\u0159i s pokro\u010dilou analytickou platformou Microbira MAAP-IR, kter\u00e1 ve spojen\u00ed s ATR FTIR p\u0159in\u00e1\u0161\u00ed rychlou, p\u0159esnou a bezreagentovou identifikaci mikroorganism\u016f p\u0159\u00edmo z kultiva\u010dn\u00ed plotny \u2013 a to b\u011bhem m\u00e9n\u011b ne\u017e 5 minut. Webin\u00e1\u0159 se kon\u00e1 ve \u010dtvrtek 26. \u010dervna v 17:00 a registrovat se na n\u011bj m\u016f\u017eete zde. Co MAAP-IR um\u00ed? MAAP-IR [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":12578,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[133,9],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-12577","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-133","category-novinky"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v26.8 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Revoluce v mikrobiologii: identifikace mikroorganism\u016f a detekce AMR b\u011bhem n\u011bkolika minut d\u00edky MAAP-IR a ATR-FTIR spektroskopii - Nicolet CZ<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-prev